{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speedboat League</strong> is a fast, thrilling, and visually striking boat racing game, inspired by classic arcade hits like <i>Wave Race</i> and <i>Eliminator Boat Duel</i>, blended with the excitement of modern kart racers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race at top speed and blast your rivals away with powerful, weaponized speedboats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766780/extras/InfoBanner.jpg?t=1749489514\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features in this demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dynamic weapons system: fire immediately or collect upgrades for even more powerful attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-game unlockables to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 stages to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two game modes, including standard race and eliminator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local split-screen multiplayer for up to 4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full boat customization \u2014 stand out from the competition</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766780/extras/InfoBanner.jpg?t=1749489514\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your speedboat season starts now \u2014 jump in and dominate the waves!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3766780?t=1749489514","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3766780?t=1749489514","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766780/4b02798d1b8dc60894402b678045673f90ab8195/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749489514","capsule_imagev5"